                "entry_id": "31e3bf54-dbf8-3497-82ec-03b9d9b3d6e6",
                "word": "twixt",
                "pos": "prep",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "226835e6-9f06-330e-8c16-fa561f0609c7",
                        "entry_id": "31e3bf54-dbf8-3497-82ec-03b9d9b3d6e6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "betwixt, between"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "literary"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2d522bae-0a01-4668-b198-ce4391d70d3a",
                                "sense_id": "226835e6-9f06-330e-8c16-fa561f0609c7",
                                "text": "O! thou thrice happy Shire, confined so to bee / Twixt two so famous Floods, as Mersey is, and Dee."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5395facf-a01c-46d6-bde4-b419298a2090",
                                "sense_id": "226835e6-9f06-330e-8c16-fa561f0609c7",
                                "text": "I then took a strait That gave myself, and some few more, receipt 'Twixt Scylla and Charybdis."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b978077c-f7d4-4fcc-a764-da4d743fd1a7",
                                "sense_id": "226835e6-9f06-330e-8c16-fa561f0609c7",
                                "text": "From all the dangers he foresees or fears; Yet every hour 'twixt Scylla and Charybdis steers."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9aa7fc6f-044f-4579-8167-4e7b193eae3c",
                                "sense_id": "226835e6-9f06-330e-8c16-fa561f0609c7",
                                "text": "The host is rushing 'twixt night and day,\nCaoilte tossing his burning hair,\nAnd Niamh calling Away, come away."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
